# Arch's default rule only advertises light and compass. The proxy also
# implements the accelerometer and proximity drivers.
#
# The SSC accelerometer's +X/+Y point opposite the panel. With the identity
# matrix, right edge up was reported as left-up and the desktop was upside
# down. Negate X and Y; +Z already matches the screen (face up is +Z).
SUBSYSTEM=="misc", KERNEL=="fastrpc-sdsp*", ENV{IIO_SENSOR_PROXY_TYPE}+="ssc-accel ssc-proximity", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="-1, 0, 0; 0, -1, 0; 0, 0, 1", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="iio-sensor-proxy.service"
